-size:15px; color:#6e6e6a; line-height:1.7;">
                                            Quantum computing has received =
significant attention over the past year, and much of the discussion has ce=
ntered on encryption, specifically whether the standards devices rely on to=
day will hold up as these machines grow more capable. The honest answer is =
that they will not, at least not indefinitely. That future may still be yea=
rs away, but the time to prepare is now.
                                        </p>

                                        <p style=3D"margin:0 0 20px 0; font=
-size:15px; color:#6e6e6a; line-height:1.7;">
                                            We are rolling out a new softwa=
re release for Ledger devices with that in mind. It incorporates post-quant=
