. Our team has spent considerable time on this work, and the release repres=
ents a meaningful step toward keeping your device protected as computing ca=
pabilities continue to evolve.
                                        </p>

                                        <p style=3D"margin:0 0 32px 0; font=
-size:15px; color:#6e6e6a; line-height:1.7;">
                                            You need to apply this release =
without delay. Devices on older software remain vulnerable to attacks, and =
waiting has, in past cases, led to situations where people lost funds. It t=
akes only a few minutes through Ledger Live. Your accounts and recovery set=
up stay exactly as they are. Do not put this off. Apply it today.
